        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b192651-rVM3182aXjwa.png"
        },
        "description": "A junior college student with little experience about camping alone. Shizuku got super interested in camping after trying to camp with friends for the first time. She decided to make Gen her mentor to develop her skills on camping alone, by contradictorily, camping together until she is able to manage on her own. She has a knack for cooking.\n\nShizuku sometimes speaks in a heavy Kyushu dialect. She has an older brother.",
