            "Master"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b205723-13BIP7OoVhT6.png"
        },
        "description": "His hobby is camping. An out-and-out solo camper who enjoys the quiet solitude away from the city. He doesn't own a car and instead prefers to use public transports such as a train or a bus. He loves every aspects of nature: fire, wood, water and soil.\n~!He lost his father while camping during his childhood.!~",
